  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lderes que Fazem Acontecer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people in the lowest-income communities of northeast Brazil face limited education and employment opportunities, a situation exacerbated by the COVID-19 crisis. Instituto Fazer Acontecer (IFA) reaches young leaders in communities of Bahia state with a curriculum that engages them in problem-solving and critical thinking to address local social and economic challenges. IFA involves young people in local development activities and supports youth-led microenterprises and initiatives. At the IAF, we support community-led approaches to creating opportunity for youth in Brazil. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s broader COVID-19 response strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
